# save: 36-CavePast
# The ending: the setup replays paula-farewell.play (debug win, farewells, Twoson, Paula's
# farewell; `emu: lstep` keeps the replay on logic frames) and respawns Polestar's NPCs. The body
# PSI Teleports (beta) to Onett (a first try by the preschool fence fails for room), walks the
# town (a talk on the dirt path north of the hotel) up the hill home, talks to Mom twice, Yes:
# the photo album and the cast roll, to the start of the credits (the-end.play takes over after
# them). Body generated with playtest/padlog_body.py
# Onett and the walks lag the original (overclocked to fit), but the album/credits hang in the
# emu overclocked (the NMI's DMA queue loop re-enters until the stack runs away): the overclock
# goes off at Mom's, before the Yes
